{
  "_about": "Cap shoot of the founder walkthrough (docs/video/demo-script.md), about 2:50 after the cut. Run with the cap-director skill: node ~/.claude/skills/cap-director/scripts/browser_shoot.mjs docs/video/cap-shoot.json, then python3 -I docs/video/cap-cut.py docs/video/raw/credence-demo.cap. Marks 'cut' / 'fast:N' ... 'end-cut' / 'end-fast' remove or speed up waits on transactions; 'beat:*' marks each section.",
